, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was typing my resume and cover letter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It's meant to be"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "destined or fated to exist "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The job is meant to be."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "big-name "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very successful company or person "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The company has big-name clients"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "client "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "customer; person who you provide a service to "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The big-name clients are the most important."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Fingers crossed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Good luck "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fingers crossed for your new job!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Do some research about a job that you are really interested in."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 6 points about the job (hours, pay, tasks,etc.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner about the job. Add many details."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner questions about their dream job."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research about a dream job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share information about the job with my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask my partner about their dream job."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, Peter, have a seat on my comfy chaise and tell me all about your life!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, enough secrecy. Tell us everything!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I applied for my dream job.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Dream job?! What is it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds exciting. My dream job is definitely being a chef. It's something I really want to do forever. What's yours, Peter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I applied to a really big PR firm in Boston. I saw the ad when I was looking through the newspaper in the kitchen. It jumped out at me right away.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's meant to be!", "id": 2, "time": "12000", "image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope so. They are the largest PR firm in the area and they have many big-name clients. I got so nervous when I was typing my resume and cover letter.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I bet!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: When do you expect to hear back from them?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe next week.", "id": 3, "time": "33500", "image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Fingers crossed!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, good luck Peter!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, you two.", "id": 4, "time": "48000", "image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about rooms and objects in them. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk or report about actions, events or people. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can say what I was doing when something else happened."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "  Do you have a dream job? What is it? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Why do you want that job?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "I applied for my dream job!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Peter talks about his <span cla